WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.400
Some of these have been on my walls for forty years.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.400
If there were a fire tonight, I could tell you exactly what I lost.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.900
I could not prove a single piece of it.

4
00:00:12.351 --> 00:00:14.625
Everything you own, in one view.

5
00:00:14.845 --> 00:00:17.524
What it's documented at. How much of it is

6
00:00:17.524 --> 00:00:18.646
actually insured.

7
00:00:18.866 --> 00:00:23.668
Then the part nobody enjoys. The gaps, counted. Four

8
00:00:23.668 --> 00:00:25.751
with no policy at all.

9
00:00:25.971 --> 00:00:28.770
And one that quietly lapsed in June. You would

10
00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.794
have found that out at the claim.

11
00:00:31.014 --> 00:00:35.523
Condition, broken down. Eight excellent. Four good.

12
00:00:35.743 --> 00:00:38.816
It isn't telling you you're covered. It's showing you

13
00:00:38.816 --> 00:00:39.840
where you aren't.

14
00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:40.772
Attesté.

